{"sha": "2ff5e0f6d99cb203852a92d91bf79e7bc5b2497d92bf2a6e5691d3269d7caf19", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:flow-balances} 章 --- 流动中的动量与能量平衡}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:1}", "$s = \\qty{7.1}{cm^2}$, $v = 0.025/7.1 \\times 10^{-4} = \\qty{35}{m/s}$; $F = D_mv = 25", "\\times 35 = \\qty{880}{N}$ 作用于喷嘴和墙面上；若墙面后退：$\\rho s(v -", "u)^2 = 1000 \\times 7.1 \\times 10^{-4} \\times 25.4^2 = \\qty{460}{N}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:2}", "$F = 250 \\times 3000 = \\qty{750}{kN}$；$a_0 = 750/60 - 9.81 = \\qty{2.7}{m/s^2}$；在", "\\qty{20}{t}时：$37.5 - 9.8 = \\qty{28}{m/s^2}$。$\\Delta v = 3000\\ln3 = \\qty{3.3}{km/s}$ 在", "自由空间中；减去 $g\\tau = \\qty{1.6}{km/s}$：\\qty{1.7}{km/s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:3}", "$S = \\qty{177}{cm^2}$：$PS = \\qty{7.1}{kN}$，$\\rho Sv^2 = \\qty{71}{N}$。弯管所受力的每个分量", "为 $PS + \\rho Sv^2 = \\qty{7.1}{kN}$：\\qty{10}{kN}，沿", "外角平分线方向，其中 $99\\%$ 来自压强。开口出口（表压", "为零）：$7.1$ kN 沿入口方向，\\qty{71}{N} 沿", "出口方向：\\qty{7.1}{kN}，几乎沿入口轴线方向。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:4}", "$F = 80 \\times 550 = \\qty{44}{kN}$。飞行时：$F = 80(550 - 240) = \\qty{25}{kN}$，$Fv =", "\\qty{6.0}{MW}$；$\\mathcal P_{\\text{动能}} = \\tfrac12 \\times 80 \\times (550^2 - 240^2) =", "\\qty{9.8}{MW}$; $\\eta_p = 0.61 = 2 \\times 240/790$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:5}", "$D_m = \\qty{500}{kg/s}$. (a) $F = 1000(60 - u)$ N, $\\mathcal P = 1000u(60 - u)$; $u =", "\\qty{30}{m/s}$, $\\omega = 37.5$ rad/s $= \\qty{360}{rpm}$. (b) \\qty{900}{kW} $=", "\\tfrac12D_mv^2$: $100\\%$. (c) $F = D_m(v - u)(1 + \\cos15^\\circ) = \\qty{29.5}{kN}$, $\\mathcal P", "= \\qty{885}{kW}$，$98\\%$。(d) $\\Gamma = FR = \\qty{24}{kN.m}$；静止时力", "加倍（$\\Gamma = \\qty{48}{kN.m}$）；当 $u = v$ 时，力与力矩均为零。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:6}", "(a) 每个喷嘴 $s = \\qty{7.1}{mm^2}$，流量各为 \\qty{0.10}{L/s}：$w = \\qty{14}{m/s}$。(b)", "$\\Gamma_0 = D_mRw = 0.2 \\times 0.15 \\times 14 = \\qty{0.42}{N.m}$. (c) $D_mR(w - R\\omega) =", "5 \\times 10^{-3}$: $w - R\\omega = \\qty{0.17}{m/s}$, $\\omega = \\qty{93}{rad/s} \\approx \\qty{890}{rpm}$;", "无摩擦时 $R\\omega = w$：\\qty{900}{rpm}。(d) \\qty{0.17}{m/s} 反向，随后", "为零：水竖直下落。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:7}", "(a) $D_m = \\rho Av_i$，动量通量 $D_m\\cdot2v_i$：$T = 2\\rho Av_i^2$；$A = \\qty{78.5}{m^2}$，", "$T = \\qty{19.6}{kN}$: $v_i = \\qty{10}{m/s}$. (b) $\\mathcal P = \\tfrac12D_m(2v_i)^2 = Tv_i =", "\\qty{200}{kW}$。(c) $\\mathcal P = T^{3/2}/\\sqrt{2\\rho A}$：面积加倍时", "使诱导功率除以 $\\sqrt2$ --- 较大的转子推动更多", "空气，但速度更慢。(d) $A = \\qty{0.20}{m^2}$，$v_i = \\sqrt{9.81/0.47} = \\qty{4.6}{m/s}$，$\\mathcal P", "= \\qty{45}{W}$：\\qty{45}{W/kg}，与 \\qty{100}{W/kg} 相比 --- 盘面载荷 $T/A$", "较低。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:8}", "(a) $v_2 = \\qty{1.0}{m/s}$；伯努利给出 $\\tfrac12\\rho(16 - 1) = \\qty{7.5}{kPa}$；实际", "$\\rho v_2(v_1 - v_2) = \\qty{3.0}{kPa}$；损失 \\qty{4.5}{kPa} $= \\qty{0.46}{m}$。(b) 回收 $6$ kPa，", "损失 \\qty{1.5}{kPa}。(c) $\\tfrac12\\rho v_1^2 = \\qty{8}{kPa}$，\\qty{0.82}{m}。(d)", "$D_V = \\qty{7.9}{L/s}$：\\qty{35}{W} 和 \\qty{63}{W}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:9}", "(a) $v = 0.01/2.83 \\times 10^{-3} = \\qty{3.5}{m/s}$，$v^2/2g = \\qty{0.64}{m}$；摩擦损失", "$0.025 \\times 1000 \\times 0.64 = \\qty{16}{m}$，管件 \\qty{1.3}{m}：\\qty{17.3}{m}。(b)", "$H = 30 + 17.3 + 0.64 = \\qty{48}{m}$；$\\rho gD_VH = \\qty{4.7}{kW}$；轴处功率为", "\\qty{7.2}{kW}。(c) 进口（不计吸入损失）：$P_0 - \\rho g(5 + 0.64) = \\qty{45}{kPa}$；", "出口 $45 + 470 = \\qty{515}{kPa}$。(d) $P_{\\text{进口}} \\ge \\qty{2.3}{kPa}$：$h \\le (100 -", "2.3)/9.81 - 0.64 = \\qty{9.3}{m}$（计入吸入损失时更小；实际中为 $7$--\\qty{8}{m}", "）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:10}", "(a) $v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 4 \\times 10^5/1000} = \\qty{28}{m/s}$; $s = \\qty{3.8}{cm^2}$, $D_m =", "\\qty{10.8}{kg/s}$, $F = D_mv = 2\\Delta P\\,s = \\qty{300}{N}$; $a = 300/1.1 - 9.8 =", "\\qty{260}{m/s^2}$。(b) 空气体积为 \\qty{1.5}{L} 时：$P = \\qty{3.3}{bar}$，$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 2.3 \\times", "10^5/1000} = \\qty{22}{m/s}$。(c) 平均出口速率 $\\approx \\qty{22}{m/s}$：燃烧时长 $\\approx 10^{-3}", "/(3.8 \\times 10^{-4} \\times 22) = \\qty{0.12}{s}$；用火箭方程，取 $v_e \\approx \\qty{22}{m/s}$：", "$\\Delta v \\approx 22\\ln(1.1/0.1) = \\qty{50}{m/s}$。(d) 剩余的 \\qty{2.5}{bar} 空气", "排出，并略微增加推力；水过多则留下很少的空气，", "压强过早下降；水过少则可抛出的质量很少 ---", "约占体积的三分之一最佳。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:11}", "(a) $\\Gamma = D_mr_1v_{\\theta1} = 3 \\times 10^4 \\times 20 = \\qty{600}{kN.m}$, $\\omega = 15.7$ rad/s,", "$\\mathcal P = \\qty{9.4}{MW}$. (b) $H = \\mathcal P/\\rho gD_V = \\qty{32}{m}$. (c) $\\Gamma = 3 \\times", "10^4(20 - 1.5) = \\qty{555}{kN.m}$，$\\mathcal P = \\qty{11.6}{MW}$（水头 \\qty{39}{m}）；", "出口涡流携带 $v_{\\theta2}^2/2g = \\qty{0.46}{m}$，约 $1\\%$。(d) 佩尔顿射流", "处于大气压强：需较高水头才能获得高速，其", "流量受喷管限制；弗朗西斯转轮充满有压的水，", "并可在中等水头下通过大流量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:flow-balances:12}", "(a) $v_1h_1 = v_2h_2 = q$。(b) 作用于截面上的单位宽度静水压力", "$\\int_0^h\\rho g(h - z)\\dd z = \\tfrac12\\rho gh^2$；动量：$\\tfrac12\\rho g(h_1^2", "- h_2^2) = \\rho q(v_2 - v_1)$；除以 $\\rho$，并利用 $q = v_1h_1 = v_2h_2$。", "(c) 取 $v_2 = v_1h_1/h_2$，且 $h_1 \\ne h_2$：$\\tfrac12g(h_1 + h_2)h_2 = v_1^2h_1$，", "即 $(h_2/h_1)^2 + h_2/h_1 - 2\\mathrm{Fr}_1^2 = 0$；$h_2 > h_1$ 需要 $\\mathrm{Fr}_1 > 1$。", "(d) $\\Delta H = (h_1 + v_1^2/2g) - (h_2 + v_2^2/2g) = (h_2 - h_1)^3/4h_1h_2$.", "$\\mathrm{Fr}_1 = 2.86$, $h_2/h_1 = 3.57$, $h_2 = \\qty{0.71}{m}$, $v_2 = \\qty{1.1}{m/s}$,", "$\\Delta H = 0.514^3/0.57 = \\qty{0.24}{m}$；$\\rho gq\\,\\Delta H = \\qty{1.9}{kW}$ 每米", "宽度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:flow-balances:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $F = (D_a + D_f)v_e = 51 \\times 600 = \\qty{30.6}{kN}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $F = 51 \\times 600 - 50 \\times 250 = \\qty{18.1}{kN}$; $Fv = \\qty{4.5}{MW}$.", ""]}